# The healthybridge-esp32 (ESP32-C6) release a firmware release bundles.
# A HealthyPi 6 tag of Protocentral/healthybridge-esp32: hp6-v<version>. (Its
# plain v* tags are HealthyPi 5 ESP32-C3 releases.) The release workflow builds
# it with ESP-IDF 6.1.1 and refuses if its version.txt does not match the tag.
hp6-v1.2.0
